{title: Fly Me To The Moon}
{artist: Frank Sinatra Westlife}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am] [Dm],        Fly me to the moon,
[G] [C],        and let me play among the stars
[F] [Dm],        Let me see what spring is like
[E] [Am],        on Jupiter and Mars
[Dm] [G] [C] [A],        In other words, hold my hand.
[Dm] [G] [C] [E],        In other words, baby kiss me.
[Am] [Dm],        Fill my heart with song,
[G] [C],        and let me sing forever more
[F] [Dm],        Youre all that I long for,
[E] [A],        all I worship and do adore.
[Dm] [G] [C] [A],        In other words, please be true!
[Dm] [G] [C] [E],        In other words, I love you!
